NOT REMOVED, but THESE WERE NOT CHECKED by Surplus Department.\n* If you would like to inspect this lot prior to bidding, you MUST schedule an appointment to do so.\n* NO TESTING was done by the Surplus Dept on the items listed.\n* This listed LOT is in UNKNOWN condition. This LOT may be missing parts and/or have some cosmetic damage. This LOT is sold AS IS, with NO GUARANTEES OR WARRANTIES. In regard to accessories, attachments, manuals, cords, etc., if it is NOT PICTURED, it is NOT INCLUDED in the sale of the item.\n* Call 901-584-7664 or e-mail kay.shelton@dcsms.org for scheduling.",
